<div n="1" type="letter"><head>240. An <hi rendition="#g">Augu&#x017F;t Ludwig von Spangenberg in Venzka.</hi></head><lb/>
<note type="editorial"><metamark>[</metamark>Kopie<metamark>]</metamark></note><dateline><hi rendition="#right"><metamark>[</metamark>Töpen, 10. Dez. 1788<metamark>]</metamark></hi></dateline><lb/>
